    "result_text": "All 276 tests pass. The implementation is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented sequential membership numbers for newly created owners:\n\n1. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `membershipNumber` integer field (`format: int32`, `minimum: 1`) to the `Owner` response schema. This regenerates `OwnerDto` with the field's getter/setter.\n\n2. **`Owner.java`** (entity) \u2014 Added a `membershipNumber` field mapped to the new `membership_number` column, with getter/setter.\n\n3. **`OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`** \u2014 Set `owner.setMembershipNumber(findAllOwners().size() + 1)` right before saving, so each new owner gets one more than the current owner count.\n\n4. **DB schemas** (hsqldb, h2, mysql, postgres) \u2014 Added the `membership_number` column to the `owners` table.\n\nThe MapStruct `OwnerMapper` maps the field automatically by name (Owner \u2194 OwnerDto). The acceptance test `Cp09Tests` (two consecutive creations differ by exactly one) passes, and the full suite of 276 tests is green.",
